### ============================================================
### 1. AUTH
### ============================================================

### 1.1 Login Admin (compte créé automatiquement au démarrage)
# → copier accessToken dans @adminToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@fibre-optique.local",
  "password": "AdminSecure1234!"
}

###

### 1.2 Inscription publique Prospect (pas de champ role)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Ayman",
  "prenom": "Yassine",
  "email": "prospect@test.com",
  "password": "Y@ssine2003"
}

###

### 1.3 Login Commercial (après création par admin — section 2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "prospect@test.com",
  "password": "Y@ssine2003"
}

###

### 1.4 Login Technicien
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tech@fibre.local",
  "password": "Y@ssine2003"
}

###

### 1.5 Login Support
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "commercial@fibre.local",
  "password": "Y@ssine2003"
}

###

### 1.6 Login Client
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "client@test.com",
  "password": "Y@ssine2003"
}

###

### 1.7 Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "REPLACE_WITH_REFRESH_TOKEN"
}

###

### 1.8 Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "REPLACE_WITH_REFRESH_TOKEN"
}

###


### ============================================================
### 2. USERS — Gestion des comptes (CRUD complet)
### ============================================================

### 2.1 CREATE — Admin crée compte COMMERCIAL
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "nom": "Dupont",
  "prenom": "Marie",
  "email": "commercial@fibre.local",
  "password": "Y@ssine2003",
  "role": "COMMERCIAL"
}

###

### 2.2 CREATE — Admin crée compte TECHNICIEN
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "nom": "Martin",
  "prenom": "Jean",
  "email": "tech@fibre.local",
  "password": "Y@ssine2003",
  "role": "TECHNICIEN"
}

###

### 2.3 CREATE — Admin crée compte SUPPORT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "nom": "Bernard",
  "prenom": "Sophie",
  "email": "support@fibre.local",
  "password": "Y@ssine2003",
  "role": "SUPPORT"
}

###

### 2.4 CREATE — Admin crée compte CLIENT direct
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "nom": "Client",
  "prenom": "Direct",
  "email": "client2@test.com",
  "password": "Y@ssine2003",
  "role": "CLIENT"
}

###

### 2.5 READ — Liste paginée de tous les utilisateurs (ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 2.6 READ — Filtrer par rôle et statut
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users?role=TECHNICIEN&enabled=true&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 2.7 READ — Recherche textuelle (nom/email)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users?query=Martin&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 2.8 READ — Get utilisateur par ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 2.9 READ — Mon propre profil (tout utilisateur)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 2.10 UPDATE — Admin modifie un utilisateur (rôle + statut)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "nom": "Dupont",
  "prenom": "Marie",
  "email": "commercial@fibre.local",
  "role": "COMMERCIAL",
  "enabled": true
}

###

### 2.11 UPDATE — Utilisateur met à jour son propre profil
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{techToken}}

{
  "nom": "Martin",
  "prenom": "Jean-Claude",
  "email": "tech@fibre.local"
}

###

### 2.12 DELETE — Désactivation soft (ADMIN)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

