### 10. OFFERS — Catalogue des offres (CRUD complet)
### ============================================================

### 10.1 CREATE — Offre FTTH sans engagement
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/offers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "nom": "Fibre 500 Mbps",
  "description": "Offre FTTH 500 Mbps sans engagement",
  "debitMontant": 200,
  "debitDescendant": 500,
  "prixHT": 24.90,
  "tauxTVA": 20.00,
  "typeEngagement": "SANS_ENGAGEMENT",
  "dureeMois": 0,
  "technologie": "FTTH",
  "actif": true
}

###

