GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/failed
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 15.4 CREATE — Envoyer un email manuellement (ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/send
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

